{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">CT/MRI 检查级基础模型：输入单位从切片走向完整 study</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Volumetric Study FMs</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_109_bme_x-title\">BME-X</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">BME-X 不是通用 MRI encoder，而是先预测组织标签、再用组织感知 DU-Net 生成增强图像的两阶段恢复模型。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Two-stage brain MRI enhancement foundation model that first estimates tissue probability maps and then conditions a Dual U-Net (DU-Net) to restore harmonized images.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">受运动、低分辨率、噪声、扫描仪或场强差异影响的结构脑 MRI</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Structural brain MRI degraded by motion, low resolution, noise, or cross-scanner field-strength shifts</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">高质量、组织强度更一致的增强 MRI，可供分割、配准与诊断</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Harmonized, artifact-corrected, high-resolution brain MRI ready for downstream morphometry, registration, and diagnosis</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1(a) · PDF p.Official full-size Figure 1 asset</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41551-024-01283-7\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_109_bme_x')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_109_bme_x')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"BME-X original paper architecture figure, Figure 1(a)\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/0ebae0bb01fd4bda5693.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1(a) · PDF p.Official full-size Figure 1 asset</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_109_bme_x', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_109_bme_x\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_109_bme_x')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_109_bme_x', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_109_bme_x\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">低质量结构脑 MRI</span><span class=\"lang-en\">MRI</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">覆盖运动、降采样、噪声、对比/扫描仪差异等退化</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests structural brain mri degraded by motion, low resolution, noise, or cross-scanner field-strength shifts and prepares initial tensor representations (MRI).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"覆盖运动、降采样、噪声、对比/扫描仪差异等退化\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests structural brain mri degraded by motion, low resolution, noise, or cross-scanner field-strength shifts and prepares initial tensor representations (MRI).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"低质量结构脑 MRI\" data-node-name-en=\"MRI\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_109_bme_x', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">低质量结构脑 MRI</span><span class=\"lang-en\">MRI</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">覆盖运动、降采样、噪声、对比/扫描仪差异等退化</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests structural brain mri degraded by motion, low resolution, noise, or cross-scanner field-strength shifts and prepares initial tensor representations (MRI).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"密集连接 U-Net 从退化图像预测背景、CSF、灰质、白质等组织标签\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Tissue-classification DU-Net to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Tissue-classification DU-Net\" data-node-name-en=\"Tissue-classification DU-Net\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_109_bme_x', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Tissue-classification DU-Net</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">密集连接 U-Net 从退化图像预测背景、CSF、灰质、白质等组织标签</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Tissue-classification DU-Net to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"作为解剖条件，不是最终分割产品\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs soft tissue within the core tissue prior dual unet mri harmonization computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"软组织标签图\" data-node-name-en=\"soft tissue\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_109_bme_x', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">软组织标签图</span><span class=\"lang-en\">soft tissue</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">作为解剖条件，不是最终分割产品</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs soft tissue within the core tissue prior dual unet mri harmonization computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将低质量 MRI 与预测组织图拼接\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs fusion within the core tissue prior dual unet mri harmonization computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"图像—组织条件融合\" data-node-name-en=\"fusion\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_109_bme_x', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">图像—组织条件融合</span><span class=\"lang-en\">fusion</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将低质量 MRI 与预测组织图拼接</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs fusion within the core tissue prior dual unet mri harmonization computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在组织先验约束下恢复清晰度、分辨率与标准化对比\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Tissue-aware enhancement DU-Net within the core tissue prior dual unet mri harmonization computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Tissue-aware enhancement DU-Net\" data-node-name-en=\"Tissue-aware enhancement DU-Net\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_109_bme_x', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Tissue-aware enhancement DU-Net</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在组织先验约束下恢复清晰度、分辨率与标准化对比</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Tissue-aware enhancement DU-Net within the core tissue prior dual unet mri harmonization computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从高质量结构 MRI 构造多种退化，联合学习组织和增强目标\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs training within the core tissue prior dual unet mri harmonization computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"合成退化—高质量配对训练\" data-node-name-en=\"training\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_109_bme_x', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">合成退化—高质量配对训练</span><span class=\"lang-en\">training</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从高质量结构 MRI 构造多种退化，联合学习组织和增强目标</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs training within the core tissue prior dual unet mri harmonization computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"一个固定模型覆盖多类结构脑 MRI 增强任务\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies MRI to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"增强 MRI\" data-node-name-en=\"MRI\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_109_bme_x', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">增强 MRI</span><span class=\"lang-en\">MRI</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">一个固定模型覆盖多类结构脑 MRI 增强任务</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies MRI to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"组织分割、皮层测量、配准和诊断模型检验实际效用与偏差\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces harmonized, artifact-corrected, high-resolution brain mri ready for downstream morphometry, registration, and diagnosis via Stage 08.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"下游验证链\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 08\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_109_bme_x', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">下游验证链</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 08</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">组织分割、皮层测量、配准和诊断模型检验实际效用与偏差</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces harmonized, artifact-corrected, high-resolution brain mri ready for downstream morphometry, registration, and diagnosis via Stage 08.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"BME-X Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 组织概率图条件化的脑 MRI 增强</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Tissue-Probability-Conditioned Dual-Domain Brain MRI Restoration &amp; Harmonization</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"BME-X：核心公式 · 组织概率图条件化的脑 MRI 增强\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"109\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"9.176106pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.774303 -69.079189 327.250356 9.176106\" width=\"327.250356pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M6.084282-4.96271L6.401896-6.481299H1.459037