" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"119.667344\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g4-76\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"130.404777\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g1-61\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"140.006479\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g4-107\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"145.692643\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g14-94\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"144.489666\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g7-71\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"151.610104\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g4-0\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"160.160206\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g7-71\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"165.564923\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g4-107\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"170.048109\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g11-49\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"176.396464\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g4-184\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"184.817056\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g7-95\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"190.829504\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g4-185\" y=\"-61.962663\"></use><use x=\"194.545562\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g14-49\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"201.740748\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g4-0\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"210.29085\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g14-83\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"215.830076\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g14-83\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"221.369301\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g14-73\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"224.686862\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g14-77\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"234.041783\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g4-185\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"238.960821\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g14-94\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"237.757843\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g7-71\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"242.664416\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g7-150\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"246.92505\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g7-71\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"251.831632\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g4-186\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"255.647308\" xlink:href=\"#m109_g4-186\" y=\"-61.962663\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">MRI 增强模型通常按 degradation 或扫描仪分别训练，且增强质量与下游价值脱节</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">MRI restoration networks were typically trained per degradation or scanner, often smoothing tissue boundaries needed by downstream tools.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">先预测组织标签，再用 tissue-aware enhancement network 统一结构脑 MRI 的运动校正、超分、去噪和扫描仪协调化</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Pre-estimate anatomical tissue segmentation probabilities to explicitly guide a tissue-aware enhancement network across diverse degradations.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">以组织标签约束增强，并验证增强图像能改善后续分割、配准与诊断模型</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Couples anatomical tissue priors with unified motion correction, super-resolution, denoising, and multi-site scanner harmonization.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">面向结构脑 MRI 的多任务图像增强，而非多器官通用编码器</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Serves as a universal structural brain MRI pre-processing and harmonization front-end improving downstream FreeSurfer/segmentation consistency.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">MRI enhancement foundation 路线代表；真实世界协议差异和前瞻证据仍有限</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Representative restoration-oriented MRI foundation model; must be audited to ensure subtle focal lesions are not harmonized away.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">先把复杂退化问题转成较稳定的组织分类，再以组织图约束增强。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">低质量图像与软组织标签共同输入第二个 DU-Net，避免只追求纹理锐化。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">一个预训练模型统一运动校正、超分、去噪、harmonization 与 3T→7T-like 增强。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Pre-estimate anatomical tissue segmentation probabilities to explicitly guide a tissue-aware enhancement network across diverse degradations.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Couples anatomical tissue priors with unified motion correction, super-resolution, denoising, and multi-site scanner harmonization.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Tissue-Probability-Conditioned Dual-Domain Brain MRI Restoration &amp; Harmonization.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">增强价值用组织分割、配准、诊断和组织体积偏差共同验证，而不只看 PSNR。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">模型专用于结构脑 MRI；组织先验错误可能把异常解剖拉向常见形态，病灶保真需单独检查。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Serves as a universal structural brain MRI pre-processing and harmonization front-end improving downstream FreeSurfer/segmentation consistency.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Representative restoration-oriented MRI foundation model; must be audited to ensure subtle focal lesions are not harmonized away.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41551-024-01283-7\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>A Foundation Model for Enhancing Magnetic Resonance Images and Downstream Segmentation, Registration and Diagnostic Tasks</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/DBC-Lab/Brain_MRI_Enhancement\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
